cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below."
title: "batch_detector: chance-calibrated cohort-effect diagnostics for multi-cohort omics"
version: 2.0.0
date-released: 2026-10-07
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/ames943/batch_detector"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Garg
    given-names: Amey
    affiliation: "Santa Clara High School"
abstract: >-
  batch_detector compares cohort (batch) effects with the response effect
  before several cohorts are pooled. For both factors it runs PERMANOVA on
  Aitchison distances, subtracts the chance level of R2, and reports the
  chance-corrected effects with a pooling recommendation and a power estimate.
keywords:
  - cohort effects
  - batch effects
  - microbiome
  - PERMANOVA
  - immunotherapy
